{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04089","headline":"扈从凤泉和崔黄门喜恩旨解严罢围之作 · 苏頲","name":"扈从凤泉和崔黄门喜恩旨解严罢围之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辇路岐山曲，储胥渭水湄。\n教成提将鼓，礼备植虞旗。\n不取从畋乐，先流去杀慈。\n舜韶同舞日，汤祝尽飞时。\n物应阳和施，人知雨露私。\n何如穆天子，七萃几劳师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}